BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.8 Tm /F1 10.2 Tf 15 TL (AI WeatherWise reduces the effort required to understand raw weather data, securely stores users\222 favorite) Tj T* (locations, and provides context-aware recommendations through Gemini AI. Its modular REST APIs,) Tj T* (role-aware security, validation, fallback behavior, and centralized error handling provide a maintainable) Tj T* (foundation for future expansion.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
