.2 .2 .2 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.8 Tm /F1 10.2 Tf 15 TL (The project demonstrates how a secure backend can combine real-time environmental data with artificial) Tj T* (intelligence to create practical user value. Through the eight completed phases, AI WeatherWise establishes) Tj T* (a clear path from ideation and requirements to implementation, verification, documentation, and) Tj T* (demonstration.) Tj T* ET
